  "sourceTitle": "Greek Vinaigrette",
  "sourceText": "Greek Vinaigrette\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 5:07pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 tablespoons olive oil\n2 tablespoons lemon juice\n2 teaspoons snipped fresh oregano or ½ tsp dried oregano, crushed\n1/8 teaspoon salt\n1/8 teaspoon black pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 In a screw-top jar, combine all ingredients. Cover and shake well.\n\nAbout\n\n\nFrom the Better Homes and Gardens New Cookbook.",
